## 📊 Data Source

The dataset used in this project was obtained from the **Zenodo** [CA Fire Weather Dataset](https://zenodo.org/records/14712845).  
We specifically used the data up to the year 2023.  

The CSV we utilized:  
- `CA_Weather_Fire_Dataset_1984-2025.csv` — contains whether or not there was a fire on a specific day and the weather  

## 📊 Processed Data

The processed version of our origional data is in labeled 'cleaned_df.csv' in this folder

The columns consist of DATE, PRECIPITATION, MAX_TEMP, MIN_TEMP, AVG_WIND_SPEED, FIRE_START_DAY,YEAR, TEMP_RANGE, WIND_TEMP_RATIO, SEASON, LAGGED_PRECIPITATION, and LAGGED_AVG_WIND_SPEED
